WEBVTT

00:13.447 --> 00:17.350
There's a hundred thousand voices in this room

00:20.553 --> 00:27.619
A tidal wave of flashing lights and gloom The

00:27.759 --> 00:35.926
industry is screaming in my ear Telling me the

00:36.006 --> 00:38.048
things I ought to fear

00:42.369 --> 00:46.471
I can see the tension in your jaw I can read the

00:46.551 --> 00:51.333
writing on the wall You don't have to say a single

00:51.393 --> 00:56.716
word I hear everything that goes unheard We can

00:56.756 --> 00:59.717
hear each other through the static A signal

00:59.757 --> 01:03.839
cutting clear across the noise When the world

01:03.919 --> 01:07.961
around us gets erratic We just listen for the

01:07.981 --> 01:11.923
other's voice Our own frequency

01:13.674 --> 01:20.406
Steady and true I'm always tuned in to you

01:34.666 --> 01:37.868
When the pain is sharp and breathing's slow

01:37.988 --> 01:41.891
You're the only one who seems to know A silent

01:41.971 --> 01:46.074
conversation in the dark I feel the little

01:46.174 --> 01:50.537
changes in your spark A subtle shift, a shadow in

01:50.637 --> 01:54.680
your eye I'll be there before you have to try

02:00.651 --> 02:03.912
We can hear each other through the static A

02:04.012 --> 02:08.133
signal cutting clear across the noise When the

02:08.233 --> 02:12.294
world around us gets erratic We just listen for

02:12.334 --> 02:17.036
the other's voice Our own frequency

02:18.356 --> 02:25.038
Steady and true I'm always tuned in to you

02:27.842 --> 02:31.443
Let the cameras flash, let the critics speak Let

02:31.503 --> 02:35.825
the record spin until it's weak They can have the

02:35.945 --> 02:40.907
fame and all the gold We have a connection they

02:41.007 --> 02:42.328
can't hold

02:44.909 --> 02:54.372
Through the static Just you and me Tuned in

02:54.552 --> 02:56.073
perfectly

